<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C, Pass 11 — Jimvu creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Jimvu` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: `race/body` points at the donor's own `Jimvu` BodyDef —
  defName-rename-only port (RSW_Jimvu, RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml), a
  6-legged (hexapod) plan built entirely from vanilla Core parts (Tail,
  Spine, Stomach, Heart, Lung x2, Kidney x2, Liver, Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/
  Eye x2/Ear x2/Nose/AnimalJaw, 6x Leg/Paw) — same as the already-confirmed
  Anooba/Borcatu precedent, no custom BodyPartDef needed.

  `leatherDef` stays vanilla Core `Leather_Plain`. `specificMeatDef`
  repoints to the already-ported `RSW_Reptomammal_Meat`
  (RSW_MlieWaveB_Resources.xml, same as Iriaz) — **no new resource needed
  at all this species**.

  Sounds repoint to the already-absorbed sound wave (`RSW_Pawn_Jimvu_*`,
  2026-09-02). texPaths are unchanged text — extracted art sits at
  Textures/swanimals/Jimvu/ (extract_bundle.py against the same live Steam
  workshop bundle every prior wave used). No `*ArtOverride` mod exists for
  Jimvu (checked against the full current ~26-mod `*ArtOverride` folder
  listing before porting).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: Desert (0.3), per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row, repointed from the bare "Jimvu" entry
  in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml (both the design and
  deployed copies).
-->
