    <description>The jimvu were native to the grasslands of the planet Naboo. The jimvu was an agile, six-legged, ungulate-like reptile whose best defense was its swiftness. Their main predators were the veermok and narglatch. They were exported as a prey species on various worlds where typically large predators where hunted for sport.</description>
